OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWednesday will be dry and
OL,6,Fsettled with some hot sunshine
OL,7,Fdeveloping, once early patches of low
OL,8,Fcloud and mist clear. Further cloud
OL,9,Fwill edge in from the northwest during
OL,10,Fthe day, turning the sunshine a little
OL,11,Fhazy in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere will be some hot, in
OL,14,Fplaces hazy sunshine to end the day,
OL,15,Fwith clear spells initially overnight.
OL,16,FHowever, cloud will increase from the
OL,17,Fnorthwest, giving the odd shower later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
